error[SC0411]: `*box` may be read before anything was assigned to it
    ╭─[ a_pointer_read_out_of_memory_written_on_one_arm_is_doubted.c:14:10 ]
    │
 14 │     int *t = *box;
    │          ────┬───  
    │              ╰───── read here
